    <img class="not-found__logo navbar__logo navbar__logo--light" src="/images/logo-light.png" alt="" />
    <img class="not-found__logo navbar__logo navbar__logo--dark" src="/images/logo-dark.png" alt="" />
    <h1>404</h1>
    <p>There's nothing here — the page may have moved or never existed.</p>
    <div class="not-found__links">
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/blog/">Blog</a>
      <a href="/about/">About</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>
